      <p class="rw-coach" data-rc-coach aria-live="polite">Closed it too soon? Your last dictation is still in memory — tap <b>R</b>.</p>
      <div class="rw-steps" role="group" aria-label="Recovery walkthrough progress">
        <span class="pager-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stepper-dot"></span><span class="stepper-dot"></span><span class="stepper-dot"></span></span>
        <span class="pager-status">Step <b class="pager-cur" data-rc-cur>1</b> of 3</span>
      </div>
      <p class="rw-footnote">In Parleq your last dictation's audio is held in memory — tap R to re-run it, no re-speaking.</p>
    </div>

    {/* SPIKE: INTERACTIVE "The AI you bring" (data-panel="hiw-ai"). A segmented
        picker — On-device / Your cloud / None — updates the result + where-note. */}
    <div data-panel="hiw-ai" class="ai-demo" hidden>
      <div class="demo-card rw-card">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="demo-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4" set:html={icons['sparkle']} /></span>
