          <button type="button" class="ai-opt" data-ai-opt="raw" aria-pressed="false">Raw</button>
        </div>
        <p class="ba-label mt-4">You said</p>
        <p class="ba-before">So we shipped the kiwi update — uh, no, two nights ago — up forty percent.</p>
        <p class="ba-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</p>
        <p class="ba-label" data-ai-reslabel>Fixed · Instant</p>
        <p class="ba-after" data-ai-result set:html={'So we shipped the <span class="mk">Keavi</span> update — uh, no, two nights ago — up <span class="mk">40%</span>.'}></p>
        <p class="ai-where" data-ai-where>Runs on your Mac — deterministic, no network, no wait.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="rw-coach" data-ai-coach aria-live="polite">Same dictation — you set how much cleanup runs.</p>
      <p class="rw-footnote">Every provider is your own account; Parleq runs no server in the path.</p>
    </div>

    {/* SPIKE: INTERACTIVE "Quick & continuous" (data-panel="hiw-quick"). Double-tap →
        dictate with no overlay → text lands straight in the focused field. */}
    <div data-panel="hiw-quick" class="qk-demo" hidden>
      <div class="demo-card rw-card">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="demo-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4" set:html={icons['bolt']} /></span>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">Quick &amp; continuous</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="chip chip-on">No overlay</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qk-field" data-qk-field>
          <span class="qk-fieldlabel">Reply · Slack</span>
          <p class="qk-text"><span data-qk-text></span><span class="rw-caret" data-qk-caret aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="rw-mic" data-qk-go><kbd class="rw-keycap">⌥⌥</kbd> Double-tap &amp; hold</button>
        <button type="button" class="rw-replay" data-qk-replay hidden>↺ Replay</button>
      </div>
      <p class="rw-coach" data-qk-coach aria-live="polite">Skip the overlay — double-tap and hold, speak, release. Text lands right in the field.</p>
      <p class="rw-footnote">Double-tap and <b>release</b> instead for hands-free continuous dictation.</p>
    </div>

    {/* SPIKE: INTERACTIVE Voice enrollment (data-panel="hiw-voice"). Read a term aloud
        → a voiceprint is saved on-device → it tells the sound-alike apart. 3 stages. */}
    <div data-panel="hiw-voice" class="vo-demo" hidden>
      <div class="demo-card rw-card">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="demo-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4" set:html={icons['wave']} /></span>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">Voice enrollment</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="chip chip-on">On-device</span>
        </div>

        {/* S0 — enroll */}
        <div class="rw-stage" data-vostage="0">
          <p class="vo-teach">Teach a sound-alike: <span class="vo-term">Keavi</span> <span class="vo-vs">not “kiwi”</span></p>
          <p class="vo-read">Read aloud: <b>“We shipped the update with Keavi.”</b></p>
          <button type="button" class="rw-mic" data-vo-read><span class="rw-mic-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Read it aloud</button>
        </div>

        {/* S1 — enrolling */}
        <div class="rw-stage" data-vostage="1" hidden>
          <p class="wf-status" data-vo-status><span class="rw-mic-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Listening…</p>
        </div>

        {/* S2 — tells them apart */}
        <div class="rw-stage" data-vostage="2" hidden>
          <div class="attach rw-attach"><span class="attach-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Voiceprint saved · on-device</div>
          <p class="ba-label mt-3">Next time you dictate</p>
          <p class="ba-before">let's sync with kiwi tomorrow</p>
          <p class="ba-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</p>
          <p class="ba-label">Heard correctly</p>
          <p class="ba-after" set:html={voAfter}></p>
          <button type="button" class="rw-replay" data-vo-replay>↺ Replay</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="rw-coach" data-vo-coach aria-live="polite">Sound-alikes trip up any recognizer. Teach Parleq your voice — read the line aloud.</p>
      <div class="rw-steps" role="group" aria-label="Voice enrollment walkthrough progress">
        <span class="pager-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stepper-dot"></span><span class="stepper-dot"></span><span class="stepper-dot"></span></span>
        <span class="pager-status">Step <b class="pager-cur" data-vo-cur>1</b> of 3</span>
      </div>
      <p class="rw-footnote">Parleq stores a voiceprint — your acoustics, not audio or a transcript — encrypted on your Mac.</p>
    </div>

    {/* SPIKE: INTERACTIVE refine loop (data-panel="refine-loop"). Dictate a draft, then
        reshape it by voice, turn by turn, and finish with a preset. 4 stages. */}
    <div data-panel="refine-loop" class="rl-demo" hidden>
      <div class="demo-card rw-card">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="demo-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4" set:html={icons['bubble']} /></span>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">The refine loop</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="chip chip-byo">Your provider</span>
        </div>

        {/* S0 — draft */}
        <div class="rw-stage" data-rlstage="0">
          <p class="ba-label mt-3">You dictated</p>
          <p class="ba-before">so um can we push the sync to thursday and i'll send the deck</p>
          <p class="ba-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</p>
          <p class="ba-label">Draft</p>
          <p class="ba-after">Can we push the sync to Thursday? I'll send the deck.</p>
          <button type="button" class="rw-mic" data-rl-next="1"><span class="rw-mic-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Refine by voice</button>
        </div>

        {/* S1 — refine 1 */}
        <div class="rw-stage" data-rlstage="1" hidden>
          <p class="refine-instr">“make it a polite email to Sam”</p>
          <p class="ba-label mt-3">Rewritten</p>
          <p class="ba-after" set:html={"Hi Sam — could we move our sync to <span class=\"mk\">Thursday</span>? I'll send the deck ahead of time."}></p>
          <button type="button" class="rw-mic" data-rl-next="2"><span class="rw-mic-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Refine again</button>
        </div>

        {/* S2 — refine 2 */}
        <div class="rw-stage" data-rlstage="2" hidden>
          <p class="refine-instr">“offer Friday as a backup”</p>
          <p class="ba-label mt-3">Rewritten</p>
          <p class="ba-after" set:html={"Hi Sam — could we move our sync to Thursday, or <span class=\"mk\">Friday</span> if that's easier? I'll send the deck ahead."}></p>
          <button type="button" class="rw-mic" data-rl-next="3">Finish ▸</button>
        </div>

        {/* S3 — finish with a preset */}
        <div class="rw-stage" data-rlstage="3" hidden>
          <p class="ba-label mt-3">One tap to finish</p>
          <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="preset-chip preset-on">Concise</span><span class="preset-chip">Formal</span><span class="preset-chip">Bulletize</span></div>
          <p class="rl-hint">Tap a preset to restyle in one more pass — or just Accept.</p>
          <div class="demo-foot">
            <span class="foot-paste">Styling · Mail</span>
            <span class="foot-actions"><span>Copy</span><span>Cancel</span><b aria-hidden="true">Accept</b></span>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="rw-replay" data-rl-replay>↺ Replay</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="rw-coach" data-rl-coach aria-live="polite">You dictated a draft. Reshape it by voice — tap to refine.</p>
      <div class="rw-steps" role="group" aria-label="Refine loop walkthrough progress">
        <span class="pager-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stepper-dot"></span><span class="stepper-dot"></span><span class="stepper-dot"></span><span class="stepper-dot"></span></span>
        <span class="pager-status">Step <b class="pager-cur" data-rl-cur>1</b> of 4</span>
      </div>
      <p class="rw-footnote">Each hotkey press treats your speech as an edit instruction — voice undo/redo.</p>
    </div>

  </div>

  {/* SPIKE: the anchored breakout window-picker — pops OVER the explorer (dimmed
      backdrop, wider than the demo card) with realistic app-window cards. Shown
      only during the Reference Windows demo's pick stage. */}
  <div class="rw-picker-overlay" data-rw-overlay hidden>
    <div class="rw-picker-backdrop" data-rw-cancel aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="rw-picker-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Choose a window to attach">
      <p class="rw-picker-title">Choose a window for context</p>
      <div class="rw-picker-grid">
        {rwWindows.map((w) => (
          <button type="button" class="rw-appwin" data-rw-appwin={w.id}
                  aria-label={`Attach ${w.app}`}
                  data-chip={w.chip} data-utterance={w.utterance} data-after={w.after}>
            <span class="rw-appwin-ic"><svg class="rw-appwin-glyph" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" set:html={icons[w.icon]} /></span>
            <span class="rw-appwin-meta"><span class="rw-appwin-name">{w.app}</span><span class="rw-appwin-sub">{w.sub}</span></span>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="rw-picker-cancel" data-rw-cancel>Cancel · Esc</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .group-tabs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 36rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-300) 24%, var(--color-border));
  }
  .group-tab {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    min-height: 4.6rem;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    border: 0;
    padding: 0 1.1rem .85rem 0;
    text-align: left;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    background: none;
  }
  .group-tab + .group-tab { padding-left: 1.1rem; }
  .group-tab + .group-tab::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: .15rem;
    bottom: 1rem;
    width: 1px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-300) 18%, transparent);
  }
  .group-tab::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 1.1rem;
    bottom: -1px;
    height: 2px;
    background: transparent;
    transition: background .18s ease;
  }
  .group-tab + .group-tab::after { left: 1.1rem; right: 0; }
  .group-tab-title {
    display: block;
    font-size: .92rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    transition: color .18s ease;
  }
  .group-tab-copy {
    display: block;
    margin-top: .45rem;
    max-width: 11rem;
    font-size: .82rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--color-text-subtle);
    transition: color .18s ease;
  }
  .group-tab[aria-selected="true"]::after { background: var(--color-grape); }
  .group-tab[aria-selected="true"] .group-tab-title { color: var(--color-grape); }
  .group-tab[aria-selected="true"] .group-tab-copy { color: var(--color-text-muted); }

  .flow-lines {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    left: 178px;
    top: 154px;
    z-index: 6;
    width: 456px;
    height: 210px;
    overflow: visible;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .flow-glow path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: url(#flowWarm);
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-width: 4.5;
    opacity: .32;
  }
  .flow-glow path:nth-child(1),
  .flow-glow path:nth-child(2) {
    stroke: url(#flowLav);
    opacity: .3;
  }
  /* normal blend — screen/plus-lighter are no-ops on a light background */
  .flow-blooms { opacity: 1; }
  .flow-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-width: 1.35;
    opacity: .96;
  }
  .flow-line-lav { stroke: url(#flowLav); }
  .flow-line-warm { stroke: url(#flowWarm); stroke-width: 1.6; opacity: .98; }
  .flow-warm-deep { stroke: url(#flowWarmDeep); opacity: .98; }
  .flow-flare { z-index: 13; }   /* above the demo card — flare + tails carry over its edge */
  .flow-thin { stroke-width: 1; opacity: .8; }
  .flow-thread { stroke-width: .85; opacity: .72; }
  .flow-edge { opacity: .5; }
  .flow-hot { stroke-width: 2.55; opacity: 1; }
  /* dash sweep retuned for the ~200-unit paths (was calibrated for 560-unit runs):
     period 460, offset 460→0 = one clean pulse entering at the cluster and exiting
     under the card */
  .flow-runners path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: url(#flowPulse);
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-width: 3.9;
    stroke-dasharray: 72 388;
    stroke-dashoffset: 460;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .flow-runners path:nth-child(2) { stroke-width: 5.3; }
  .flow-sharp .flow-hot,
  .flow-sharp .flow-warm-deep,
  .flow-sharp .flow-line-warm + .flow-line-warm {
    filter:
      drop-shadow(0 0 3px rgba(255, 213, 144, .72))
      drop-shadow(0 0 7px rgba(255, 159, 51, .5));
  }
  #explorer.is-pulsing .flow-runners path {
    animation: flow-run 1.2s cubic-bezier(.22,.72,.2,1) both;
  }
  #explorer.is-pulsing .flow-runners path:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .06s; }
  #explorer.is-pulsing .flow-runners path:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .12s; }

  @keyframes flow-run {
    0% { stroke-dashoffset: 460; opacity: 0; }
    10% { opacity: .98; }
    62% { opacity: .92; }
    100% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; opacity: 0; }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .flow-lines { display: block; }
  }

  .bunch {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    width: 286px;
    height: 308px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 28px 34px rgba(36, 16, 62, .18));
  }
  .bunch::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 33px;
    top: 46px;
    width: 210px;
    height: 238px;
    border-radius: 48% 52% 44% 56%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(70% 62% at 50% 42%, rgba(118, 61, 195, .18), transparent 62%),
      radial-gradient(50% 45% at 44% 54%, rgba(26, 8, 49, .68), transparent 74%);
    filter: blur(16px);
    opacity: .86;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .grape {
    position: absolute;
    height: 5.55rem;
    width: 5.55rem;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: default;
    transform: scale(var(--scale, 1));
    transform-origin: center;
  }
  .grape-orb {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: .18rem;
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(42% 36% at 36% 23%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .13), transparent 58%),
      radial-gradient(105% 96% at 48% 28%, #56308b 0%, #33165b 48%, #1e0b3a 100%);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 2px 5px rgba(255,255,255,.13),
      inset 10px 0 18px rgba(122, 72, 199, .12),
      inset 0 -18px 22px rgba(12,3,24,.55),
      0 18px 24px -14px rgba(18, 6, 34, .75);
    transition: background .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease, transform .16s ease, filter .25s ease, opacity .25s ease;
  }
  .grape-orb::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 5px 8px auto 12px;
    height: 32%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(255,255,255,.18), transparent 72%);
    transform: rotate(-18deg);
    z-index: -1;
  }
  .grape-orb::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(218, 196, 255, .08);
    z-index: 3;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .g-lb {
    display: block;
    max-width: 5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.04;
    color: rgba(250, 245, 255, .84);
    text-shadow:
      0 1px 1px rgba(9, 3, 20, .62),
      0 -1px 0 rgba(211, 178, 246, .16);
  }
  .g-ic, .g-lb { opacity: 0; transition: opacity .28s ease; }
  .g-ic {
    color: #d8b9fb;
    filter:
      drop-shadow(0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08))
      drop-shadow(0 0 7px rgba(176, 105, 234, .18));
  }

  .grape[data-tone="center"] .grape-orb {
    background:
      radial-gradient(42% 36% at 36% 22%, rgba(255,255,255,.16), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(106% 98% at 48% 28%, #5e3596 0%, #38186a 48%, #200d3f 100%);
  }
  .grape[data-tone="shadow"] .grape-orb {
    background:
      radial-gradient(42% 36% at 38% 22%, rgba(255,255,255,.1), transparent 58%),
      radial-gradient(108% 100% at 48% 30%, #3d2168 0%, #281149 58%, #19082f 100%);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 2px 4px rgba(255,255,255,.08),
      inset 0 -18px 22px rgba(8, 2, 17, .68),
      0 14px 22px -16px rgba(20, 5, 35, .66);
  }

  /* ACTIVE family: stamped content visible, selectable */
  .grape[data-active="true"] { cursor: pointer; }
  .grape[data-active="true"] .g-ic, .grape[data-active="true"] .g-lb { opacity: 1; }
  /* The grape in the receded "shadow" slot sits behind the center orb; when its
     family is active, lift it forward so it's clickable (e.g. Per-app on Refine).
     Blanks never go active, so this never lifts a filler orb. */
  .grape[data-tone="shadow"][data-active="true"] { z-index: 18 !important; }
  /* BLANK filler orbs (how-it-works): complete the cluster shape, never interactive.
     Styled like the receded inactive-family grapes so the silhouette matches. */
  .grape-blank { cursor: default; pointer-events: none; }
  .grape-blank .grape-orb { filter: brightness(.82) saturate(.84); opacity: .85; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 3px rgba(255,255,255,.07), inset 0 -14px 20px rgba(10,3,20,.62), 0 10px 18px -14px rgba(10,3,20,.65); }
  /* INACTIVE family: plain dark grapes, recede into the bunch */
  .grape[data-active="false"] .grape-orb { filter: brightness(.82) saturate(.84); opacity: .88; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 3px rgba(255,255,255,.07), inset 0 -14px 20px rgba(10,3,20,.62), 0 10px 18px -14px rgba(10,3,20,.65); }
  .grape[data-active="false"] .g-ic { filter: none; }

  .grape[data-active="true"]:hover { z-index: 20; }
  .grape[data-active="true"]:hover .grape-orb { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(255,255,255,.16), inset 0 -14px 20px rgba(10,3,20,.55), 0 18px 28px -13px rgba(10,3,20,.6); }
  .grape:focus-visible { outline: none; }
  .grape[data-active="true"]:focus-visible .grape-orb { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 55%, transparent), inset 0 -10px 18px rgba(10,3,20,.5); }

  /* SELECTED: glows bright violet */
  .grape[data-selected="true"][data-active="true"] { z-index: 30 !important; }
  .grape[data-selected="true"][data-active="true"] .grape-orb {
    background:
      radial-gradient(42% 36% at 38% 22%, rgba(255,255,255,.24), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(120% 112% at 50% 24%, #c79bf0 0%, #9251df 48%, #6124b4 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-200) 80%, transparent), 0 0 36px -2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-400) 95%, transparent), inset 0 2px 6px rgba(255,255,255,.3), inset 0 -15px 20px rgba(40,15,80,.45);
    transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.035);
  }
  .grape[data-selected="true"][data-active="true"] .g-lb { color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(60,20,110,.5), 0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,.22); }
  .grape[data-selected="true"][data-active="true"] .g-ic { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,.24)); }
  .grape[data-selected="true"][data-active="true"] .g-ic :global(g:first-child) { stroke: #552493; stroke-opacity: .48; }
  .grape[data-selected="true"][data-active="true"] .g-ic :global(g:last-child) { stroke: #f4e8ff; stroke-opacity: .94; }

  /* Fixed height (fits the longest 2-line preview) so hovering a grape — which
     swaps this description — never reflows the column and jogs the demo card. */
  /* Fixed height (reserved for the longest ~3-line description) so switching grapes
     never reflows the column — but tall enough that Fuller cleanup / Per-app aren't clipped. */
  .bunch-preview { margin-top: 1.6rem; max-width: 19rem; font-size: .82rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--color-text-muted); height: 4.5em; overflow: hidden; }
  .bunch-preview b { color: var(--color-text); font-weight: 600; }

  /* demo panel */
  .demo-stack {
    position: relative;
  }
  .demo-backplate {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    border-radius: .95rem;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, #1c2128, #171c22);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
    box-shadow: 0 26px 64px -30px rgba(8,3,18,.7);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .demo-card {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 12;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: .95rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 1.05rem, #1c2128 1.05rem 100%);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem;
    box-shadow: none;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }
  .demo-card > * {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .demo-backplate { display: block; }
  }
  .demo-ic { display:inline-flex; height:1.9rem; width:1.9rem; align-items:center; justify-content:center; border-radius:.55rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-400) 30%, transparent); color: var(--color-grape-100); }
  .chip { flex-shrink:0; border-radius:.5rem; padding:.18rem .6rem; font-size:.68rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.02em; }
  .chip-on  { color:#bbf7d0; background: color-mix(in srgb, #34d399 16%, transparent); border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, #34d399 32%, transparent); }
  .chip-byo { color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14); }
  .chip-raw { color: rgba(255,255,255,.45); background: rgba(255,255,255,.03); border:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.18); }
  .refine-instr { margin-top:.85rem; border-left:2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 60%, transparent); padding-left:.7rem; font-size:.8rem; line-height:1.5; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); }
  .preset-chip { border-radius:9999px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15); padding:.18rem .65rem; font-size:.66rem; font-weight:600; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); }
  .preset-on { color:#fcd9a3; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 22%, transparent); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 80%, transparent); }
  .ba-label { font-size:.6rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,.38); }
  .ba-before { margin-top:.25rem; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size:.82rem; line-height:1.5; color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); }
  .ba-arrow { margin:.4rem 0; font-size:.8rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.3); }
  .ba-after { margin-top:.25rem; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size:.82rem; line-height:1.5; color:#f1f5f9; }
  /* `:global(.mk)` — the highlighted tokens live inside set:html / runtime-injected
     content, which Astro does NOT stamp with the scope hash; a plain scoped `.mk`
     selector would never match them. The ancestor `.ba-after` is still scoped. */
  .ba-after :global(.mk) { color:#e9d5ff; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-400) 45%, transparent); border-radius:3px; padding:0 .2em; font-weight:600; }
  .attach { margin-top:.85rem; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.4rem; border-radius:.45rem; border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 40%, transparent); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 10%, transparent); padding:.25rem .6rem; font-size:.7rem; font-weight:500; color:#fcd9a3; }
  .attach-dot { height:.4rem; width:.4rem; border-radius:9999px; background: var(--color-accent); }
  .demo-foot { margin-top:1.1rem; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:.75rem; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); padding-top:.8rem; }
  .foot-paste { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size:.62rem; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,.4); }
  .foot-actions { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; font-size:.68rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); }
  .foot-actions b { border-radius:.4rem; background: var(--color-accent); padding:.18rem .6rem; color:#fff; font-weight:600; }

  /* SPIKE: three-family visibility. Only the active family's grapes occupy the
     bunch — the how-it-works overlay grapes reuse the same positions, so we hide
     whichever family isn't active. Cleanup/Refine keep their existing
     receded-inactive look between themselves; the how-it-works grapes only appear
     on their own tab. */
  #explorer[data-tab="howitworks"] .grape:not([data-group="howitworks"]) { display: none; }
  #explorer:not([data-tab="howitworks"]) .grape[data-group="howitworks"] { display: none; }

  /* Step indicator for the interactive walkthroughs: dots + "Step N of M" (in .rw-steps). */
  .pager-dots { display:inline-flex; gap:.4rem; }
  .stepper-dot { height:.42rem; width:.42rem; border-radius:9999px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape) 22%, var(--color-border)); transition: background .18s ease, width .18s ease; }
  .stepper-dot[data-on="true"] { width:1.1rem; background: var(--color-grape); }
  .pager-status { font-size:.72rem; letter-spacing:.02em; color: var(--color-text-subtle); }
  .pager-status b { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-weight:700; }
  /* When an interactive demo is showing, drop the dark backplate so the
     coachmark + step indicator read on the light section bg. */
  .demo-stack:has(.rw-demo:not([hidden])) .demo-backplate,
  .demo-stack:has(.wf-demo:not([hidden])) .demo-backplate,
  .demo-stack:has(.rc-demo:not([hidden])) .demo-backplate,
  .demo-stack:has(.ai-demo:not([hidden])) .demo-backplate,
  .demo-stack:has(.qk-demo:not([hidden])) .demo-backplate,
  .demo-stack:has(.vo-demo:not([hidden])) .demo-backplate,
  .demo-stack:has(.rl-demo:not([hidden])) .demo-backplate { display: none; }

  /* BUGFIX: walkthrough cards hide the backplate, so the demo-card's transparent
     left strip (a stacked-card flourish that normally reveals the backplate) would
     instead expose the flow-line SVG. Give walkthrough cards a SOLID background. */
  .rw-card { background: #1c2128; }
  /* Walkthrough panels are a taller stack (card + coachmark + step indicator), and
     the interactive demo's card GROWS between stages (short at "attach", tall at the
     result). With the grid's default items-center, a tall stage made the demo column
     the tallest grid item, so the row grew and the LEFT column re-centered downward —
     pushing the tabs down (widening the gap under the paragraph), dragging them onto
     the card top again, and floating the fixed-offset flow lines above the grapes.
     Fix: pin BOTH columns to the top on this tab so the card grows DOWNWARD only —
     the tabs, grapes, and flow lines never move, and the card clears the tabs by a
     fixed 7.5rem regardless of which stage is showing. */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    #explorer[data-tab="howitworks"] { align-items: start; }
    #explorer[data-tab="howitworks"] .demo-stack { margin-top: 7.5rem; }
  }
  #explorer[data-tab="howitworks"] .flow-lines { top: 96px; }

  /* SPIKE: interactive Reference Windows demo. The dark .rw-card is the "example";
     the coachmark + pager sit below it on the light section bg. */
  .rw-card { min-height: 14rem; }
  .rw-stage { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .rw-listening { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; font-size:.82rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); }
  .rw-mic-dot { height:.5rem; width:.5rem; border-radius:9999px; background:#f87171; box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(248,113,113,.5); animation: rw-rec 1.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .rw-space { margin-top:1.1rem; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; border-radius:.6rem; border:1px solid rgba(216,185,251,.28); background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); padding:.5rem .8rem; font-size:.85rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,.85); cursor:pointer; animation: rw-pulse 1.9s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .rw-space:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
  .rw-keycap { border-radius:.35rem; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28); border-bottom-width:2px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.1); padding:.05rem .5rem; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size:.72rem; color:#fff; }
  .rw-footnote { margin-top:.5rem; text-align:center; font-size:.68rem; color: var(--color-text-subtle); }

  /* Anchored breakout window-picker — surfaces OVER the explorer on the same dark
     product surface as the overlay card (not a white sheet), so it reads as the
     app popping up rather than a foreign panel. Subtle dimmed backdrop; clean
     app tiles (glyph + name + one-line context), no emoji, no fake title bars. */
  .rw-picker-overlay { position:absolute; inset:-1.5rem; z-index:50; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:1rem; }
  .rw-picker-backdrop { position:absolute; inset:0; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-950) 12%, transparent); }
  .rw-picker-panel { position:relative; z-index:1; width:100%; max-width:32rem; border-radius:1rem; border:1px solid rgba(216,185,251,.16); background: linear-gradient(180deg, #20262e, #171c22); box-shadow: 0 40px 90px -32px rgba(10,4,20,.72); padding:1.3rem; animation: rw-pop .22s cubic-bezier(.22,.72,.2,1.2) both; }
  .rw-picker-title { text-align:center; font-size:.86rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.01em; color: rgba(255,255,255,.9); }
  .rw-picker-grid { margin-top:1.1rem; display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap:.6rem; }
  .rw-appwin { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:.6rem; border-radius:.7rem; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); background: rgba(255,255,255,.03); padding:.85rem .85rem 1rem; text-align:left; cursor:pointer; transition: transform .14s ease, border-color .14s ease, background-color .14s ease; }
  .rw-appwin:hover, .rw-appwin:focus-visible { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-300) 55%, transparent); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-400) 14%, transparent); outline:none; }
  .rw-appwin-ic { display:inline-flex; height:2.1rem; width:2.1rem; align-items:center; justify-content:center; border-radius:.6rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-400) 30%, transparent); color: var(--color-grape-100); }
  .rw-appwin-glyph { width:1.15rem; height:1.15rem; }
  .rw-appwin-meta { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.1rem; }
  .rw-appwin-name { font-size:.82rem; font-weight:600; color: rgba(255,255,255,.92); }
  .rw-appwin-sub { font-size:.7rem; color: rgba(216,185,251,.62); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .rw-picker-cancel { margin:1.1rem auto 0; display:block; border-radius:9999px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); background: transparent; padding:.35rem 1rem; font-size:.76rem; font-weight:600; color: rgba(255,255,255,.62); cursor:pointer; transition: color .14s ease, border-color .14s ease; }
  .rw-picker-cancel:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.4); color: rgba(255,255,255,.9); }
  @keyframes rw-pop { from { opacity:0; transform: scale(.94); } to { opacity:1; transform: scale(1); } }
  /* On desktop, anchor the panel directly over the demo card (right column) and
     size it to cover the card with a small breakout margin, so the example window
     doesn't peek out top/right — it reads as the overlay surfacing the chooser.
     Coordinates are keyed to this component's layout: 300px sidebar + gap-x-12
     (3rem) locate the right column; the how-it-works demo-stack sits at
     margin-top 7.5rem (see the align-self:start rule); the overlay is inset -1.5rem.
     Card = max-w-md (28rem) × min-height 14rem; 0.75rem breakout on each edge. */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .rw-picker-panel {
      position: absolute;
      top: 8.25rem;                    /* 7.5rem card top − 0.75rem breakout + 1.5rem overlay inset */
      left: calc(300px + 3.75rem);     /* 300px sidebar + 3rem gap − 0.75rem breakout + 1.5rem inset */
      width: calc(28rem + 1.5rem);     /* card width + breakout both sides */
      max-width: none;
      min-height: calc(14rem + 1.5rem);/* card min-height + breakout top/bottom */
    }
  }
  .rw-steps { margin-top:1rem; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:.6rem; }

  /* SPIKE: whole-flow spine demo — reuses .rw-card / .rw-stage / .rw-mic / .ba-*. */
  .wf-status { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; font-size:.82rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); }
  .wf-corrections { margin-top:.7rem; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.45rem; }
  .wf-corr { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.4rem; border-radius:9999px; border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-300) 40%, transparent); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-400) 16%, transparent); padding:.2rem .65rem .2rem .28rem; font-size:.72rem; color: var(--color-grape-100); cursor:pointer; transition: opacity .14s ease, border-color .14s ease; }
  .wf-corr b { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; height:1.2rem; width:1.2rem; border-radius:9999px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-400) 48%, transparent); font-size:.66rem; font-weight:700; color:#fff; }
  .wf-corr:hover { border-color: var(--color-grape-300); }
  .wf-corr[data-off="true"] { opacity:.5; }
  .wf-corr[data-off="true"] span, .wf-corr[data-off="true"] { text-decoration: line-through; text-decoration-color: rgba(255,255,255,.4); }
  .ba-after :global(.mk.wf-off) { color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); background: none; text-decoration: line-through; text-decoration-color: rgba(255,255,255,.35); font-weight:400; }
  .wf-hint { margin-top:.75rem; font-size:.72rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); }
  .wf-kbd { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.3rem; border:none; background:none; padding:0; font:inherit; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); cursor:pointer; }
  .wf-kbd:hover { color:#fff; }
  .ba-after.wf-editing { outline:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 60%, transparent); border-radius:.4rem; padding:.3rem .45rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,.03); }

  /* SPIKE: recovery demo — the "lost" notice + its warning glyph. */
  .rc-lost { margin-top:.4rem; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:.5rem; font-size:.85rem; line-height:1.45; color: rgba(255,255,255,.62); }
  .rc-warn { flex-shrink:0; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; height:1.15rem; width:1.15rem; border-radius:9999px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 24%, transparent); color:#fcd9a3; font-size:.72rem; font-weight:700; }

  /* SPIKE: "The AI you bring" — segmented engine picker + where-it-runs note. */
  .ai-seg { margin-top:1rem; display:inline-flex; gap:.25rem; padding:.2rem; border-radius:.7rem; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); }
  .ai-opt { border-radius:.5rem; border:1px solid transparent; background:none; padding:.32rem .7rem; font-size:.76rem; font-weight:600; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); cursor:pointer; transition: color .14s ease, background-color .14s ease, border-color .14s ease; }
  .ai-opt:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,.9); }
  .ai-opt.is-on { color:#fff; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-400) 34%, transparent); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-300) 45%, transparent); }
  .ai-where { margin-top:.7rem; font-size:.73rem; line-height:1.45; color: rgba(216,185,251,.66); }

  /* SPIKE: "Quick & continuous" — a mock focused field the dictation types into. */
  .qk-field { margin-top:1rem; border-radius:.6rem; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); padding:.7rem .8rem; min-height:4.2rem; }
  .qk-fieldlabel { font-size:.62rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,.34); }
  .qk-text { margin-top:.4rem; font-size:.9rem; line-height:1.5; color:#f1f5f9; min-height:1.5em; }

  /* SPIKE: voice enrollment — the term to teach + the read-aloud line. */
  .vo-teach { margin-top:.5rem; display:flex; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.5rem; font-size:.82rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); }
  .vo-term { border-radius:.4rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-400) 40%, transparent); color:#e9d5ff; padding:.1rem .5rem; font-weight:700; }
  .vo-vs { font-size:.74rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.42); }
  .vo-read { margin-top:.9rem; border-left:2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-grape-300) 45%, transparent); padding-left:.7rem; font-size:.85rem; line-height:1.5; color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); }

  /* SPIKE: refine loop — the "or just Accept" hint under the preset chips. */
  .rl-hint { margin-top:.75rem; font-size:.73rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); }
  .rw-utterance { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .rw-caret { display:inline-block; width:2px; height:1em; margin-left:1px; vertical-align:text-bottom; background:rgba(255,255,255,.6); animation: rw-blink 1s step-end infinite; }
  .rw-mic { margin-top:1.1rem; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; border-radius:9999px; border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 70%, transparent); background: var(--color-accent-hover); padding:.5rem .9rem; font-size:.85rem; font-weight:600; color:#fff; cursor:pointer; animation: rw-pulse 1.9s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .rw-mic[data-recording="true"] { background:#b91c1c; border-color:#b91c1c; animation:none; }
  .rw-replay { margin-top:1rem; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.35rem; border-radius:9999px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); padding:.35rem .8rem; font-size:.78rem; font-weight:600; color:rgba(255,255,255,.8); cursor:pointer; }
  .rw-replay:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.12); color:#fff; }
  .rw-coach { margin-top:.9rem; text-align:center; font-size:.82rem; line-height:1.45; color: var(--color-text-muted); min-height:2.6em; }
  .rw-coach b { color: var(--color-text); font-weight:600; }
  @keyframes rw-pulse { 0%,100% { box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(216,185,251,0); } 50% { box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(216,185,251,.16); } }
  @keyframes rw-rec { 0%,100% { box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(248,113,113,.5); } 50% { box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(248,113,113,0); } }
  @keyframes rw-blink { 0%,100% { opacity:1; } 50% { opacity:0; } }

  /* Mobile (< lg): the flow lines are already hidden, so drop the two-column
     grid and stack simply — the interactive bunch on top, the demo card below.
     Cap everything to the viewport and let the monospace before/after wrap so
     the dark card never overflows the screen (the grid's default auto track
     sizes to the card's max-content and pushes it off-screen otherwise). */
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    #explorer { display: block; }
    #explorer > .relative { max-width: 100%; }
    /* Let tab titles wrap on small screens — the fixed 3-col grid + nowrap titles
       ("Refine & Shape" / "How it works") otherwise set a min-content floor that
       overflows a ~320px viewport. Titles only wrap when they don't fit. */
    .group-tab-title { white-space: normal; }
    .bunch { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    /* The bunch is a fixed 286px box (absolutely-positioned grapes), which overflows
       the content column on the narrowest phones (≤~334px). zoom shrinks the layout
